<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Security realm that signs users in with Google OAuth and turns their direct Google Group
  memberships into Jenkins authorities, so authorization strategies such as Role Strategy can
  bind roles to Google Group emails instead of local users. Group resolution uses the
  logged-in user's own OAuth token via the Cloud Identity API; no service account or
  Workspace admin grant is required. Note: only direct (non-nested) group memberships
  resolve.
</div>
